    "title": "Phoenix Suns at San Antonio Spurs: Odds, Injury Updates, How to Watch and More",
    "text": "Date: March 19, 2026Time: 8 p.m. ETVenue: Frost Bank CenterTV: AZFamilyStreaming: Check local listingsRadio: 1200 WOAI, Arizona Sports 98.7 FMBuy tickets: Buy Suns at Spurs tickets on StubHubThe Suns are staring down a pretty large 9.5-point disadvantage in the spread for Thursday's game. Their road trip will continue as they head out to face the San Antonio Spurs at 8:00 p.m. on Thursday at Frost Bank Center. The two teams have allowed few points on average (the Suns 111.4, the Spurs 111.7) so any points scored will be well earned.AdvertisementOn Tuesday, the Suns couldn't handle the Timberwolves and fell 116-104.Despite the loss, the Suns had strong showings from Devin Booker, who posted 34 points and 6 rebounds, and Oso Ighodaro, who dropped a double-double with 16 points and 10 rebounds. The game marked Booker's fourth in a row with at least 31 points. Jalen Green wasn't nearly as helpful, having shot 3-17 from the field.Meanwhile, the Spurs waltzed into their contest on Tuesday with two straight wins...and they left with three. They blew past Sacramento 132-104. The over/under was set at 235.5 points, so nice work oddsmakers; you were right on the money.AdvertisementMultiple players turned in solid performances to lead the Spurs to victory, but perhaps none more so than De'Aaron Fox, who scored 15 points in addition to 6 assists and 5 rebounds. Fox has been seeing the basket well recently, as he's shot 52.2% over his last 30 games vs 46.4% previously this season. Harrison Barnes was another key player, going 6-for-7 en route to 16 points.The Spurs were working as a unit and finished the game with 41 assists. That's the most assists they've managed all season.San Antonio's win bumped their record up to 51-18. As for Phoenix, they dropped their record down to 39-30 with the defeat, which was their third straight on the road.AdvertisementPhoenix Suns at San Antonio Spurs Odds, Line and SpreadBetting lines as of 03/19/2026 at 10:54 AM ET. Odds subject 